her in a traditional white thobe and red ghutra, and their young child wearing a bucket hat walking hand-in-hand and smiling at each other. They are strolling past large grey columns and green plants.\" width=\"1920\" height=\"350\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Alfursan/partners/hotel-partners/GeminiGeneratedImagewi5oo1wi5oo1wi5o-1web.ashx?h=350&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=0ed4a9bade3d491a80a3ca0a8f0a3044&amp;hash=A5CBED510E8CCA29F5D211846984F215\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"d82af6fe-40cc-4d42-9d6f-dacfff1cd746\"></div></div><!----><!----><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"swiper-slide__content\"><!----><!----><h1 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Intercontinental Hotels Group</span><!----></h1><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div class=\"custom-pagination ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div id=\"cpage_banner\" class=\"custom-pages\"></div></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-jss-image-link-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n<div class=\"saudia-partner-wrapper\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2 class=\"saudia-h2\">About partner</h2>\n<p>With over 17 hotel brands along with <a class=\"saudia-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ihg.com/onerewards/content/gb/en/home\" target=\"_blank\">IHG One Rewards</a>, IHG is one of the world's largest hotel loyalty programs. IHG Hotels &amp; Resorts has over 6,000 open hotels in more than 100 countries, presenting AlFursan members a wide range of opportunities to earn more Reward Miles so they can redeem their next Reward Ticket sooner.</p>\n<p><strong>To earn Reward Miles ensure you have selected 'Saudia | AlFursan' as your earning preference in your IHG One Rewards profile.</strong></p>\n<h3 class=\"saudia-h3\">Earning scheme</h3>\n<p>2 Reward Miles for every 1 USD spent at the qualifying hotel brands:</p>\n<ul class=\"saudia-list--unordered\">\n    <li>Regent® Hotels &amp; Resorts</li>\n    <li>InterContinental® Hotels &amp; Resorts</li>\n    <li>Kimpton® Hotels &amp; Restaurants</li>\n    <li>Hualuxe® Hotels &amp; Resorts</li>\n    <li>Crowne Plaza® Hotels &amp; Resorts</li>\n    <li>voco™</li>\n    <li>Hotel Indigo®</li>\n    <li>EVEN® Hotels</li>\n    <li>avid™ Hotels</li>\n    <li>Holiday Inn®</li>\n    <li>Holiday Inn® Express</li>\n    <li>Holiday Inn® Resort</li>\n    <li>Holiday Inn® Club Vacations</li>\n</ul>\n<p>1 AlFursan Reward Mile for every 1 USD spent at the qualifying hotel brands:</p>\n<ul class=\"saudia-list--unordered\">\n    <li>Candlewood® Suites</li>\n    <li>Staybridge® Suites</li>\n    <li>Venetian | Palazzo (Las Vegas | Macao)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"saudia-h2\">Terms and conditions</h2>\n<ul class=\"saudia-list--unordered\">\n    <li>AlFursan members must be IHG One Rewards members to collect Reward Miles at qualifying hotels and resorts worldwide.</li>\n    <li>All mentions of 'Miles' is in reference to Reward Miles.</li>\n    <li>Miles are credited within 6 weeks.</li>\n    <li>Reward Miles can only be earned by selecting AlFursan.</li>\n    <li>Visit <a class=\"saudia-link\" href=\"/sitecore/service/notfound.aspx?item=web%3a%7bA9468489-E135-48B6-A10C-C67B3CA35FDB%7d%40en\">AlFursan terms and conditions</a> for more details.</li>\n    <li>Visit <a class=\"saudia-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ihg.com/content/gb/en/customer-care/tc.html\" target=\"_blank\">IHG One Rewards terms and conditions</a> for more details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class=\"saudia-h3\">For missing Miles please contact us at:</h3>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ihg.com/content/us/en/customer-care/main\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.ihg.com/content/us/en/customer-care/main</a></p>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}